---------------------------------------------------------------------

FINAL UPGRADE — CONTEXT COMPRESSION LAYER

Large documentation sets should not be loaded entirely.

Prioritize context loading in this order:

1 code-map.md  
2 feature-boundaries.md  
3 relevant file-index docs  
4 architecture docs  
5 debugging docs  

Only load minimal required context.

